# WASM Emit — Deep-Dive REDTEAM Audit & Hardening
Floor: 2
Thrust: 10
Patch: 1
File: openOODA/audit/wasm_emit-deep-dive.oot

Zero-dependency WASM binary module generator: wasm_binary_builder.oo, wasm_direct_emit.oo, wasm_backend_driver.oo, wasm_leb128.oo.

## 0. Scope & First Principles
WASM 1.0 spec §5: magic 00 61 73 6d 01 00 00 00, LEB128 varint, func type 0x60, sections type(1)/import(2)/func(3)/memory(5)/export(7)/code(10)/data(11). Typecheck via oodac check OK on all 5 files; wasmtime 47.0.3 validates 238-byte module.

## 1. 8D Veto Matrix
e1 Heuristic Hunter Φ1: typed AST via tokenize_lines→ast_parse→wasm_lower_* — REFUTED.
e2 Boundary Falsifier Φ2: encode_u32_leb128 lacked bounds — surviv mutant 4294967296 — HARDENED with u32_negative/u32_overflow fail-closed (process_exit 1).
e3 Data-Path Tracer Φ3: wasm_direct_emit sh -c printf fallback silent — HARDENED to pure write_file fail-closed, deleted 38 lines.
e4 Hermetic Jailor Φ4: sh injection via out_path concatenation + OODA_FS_WRITEDIR bypass — HARDENED to &FsWriteCap-only, injection removed.
e5 Temporal Saboteur Φ5: List append racy under concurrency but single-threaded deterministic — cmp 0 bit-identical proves replay.
e6 Drag Assassin Φ6: wasm_builder_add_type O(N*flat) dedup — bounded by 4096 fn gate, List copy O(N) — AMBER acceptable.
e7 Semantic Subverter Φ7: swap sec ids + remove op_end survives magic-only smoke — residual, needs section validator.
e8 Byzantine Infiltrator Φ8: LEB variable loop timing leak + RASP bypass via sh — fixed via e4 removal, timing low-severity.

## 2. E-M & 80/20
Ps,info=((T-D)/W)*V: T direct emission, D rebuild/token/alloc minimized, W 747 lines, V sub-second. 80/20 leverage LEB128+frame_sec+locals_slice. Blue ocean: zero-copy bytes_to_str→write_file replaces sh compat layer.

## 3. Hardening
wasm_direct_emit.oo 128 lines: pure FsWriteCap, guard chars_len==0, compat shim retains &ProcessCap shadow.
wasm_backend_driver.oo 142 lines: explicit wasi/browser/wasm-gc/wasm-linear else ERR unknown_target.
wasm_leb128.oo 202 lines: u32 bounds gates.
wasm/mod.oo 19 lines: tactical entry door per Pillar 6.

